class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ask Us</span></p><h1 class=\"bd-h bd-h--1 bd-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Questions, answered</span></h1><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-lede bd-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We’re so excited to celebrate with you! Here are a few helpful details as you plan for our wedding. We’ll update this page as the day gets closer.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"search\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"search-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Search the site\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"search-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Search the site</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><form class=\"bd-form bd-form--search\" role=\"search\" method=\"get\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-form=\"\"><div class=\"bd-field\"><label class=\"bd-label\" for=\"ask-q\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What are you looking for?</span></label><p class=\"bd-hint\" id=\"ask-q-hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">For example: valet, kids, Cindy’s, dress code</span></p><input id=\"ask-q\" class=\"bd-input\" aria-describedby=\"ask-q-hint\" type=\"search\" minlength=\"2\" maxlength=\"200\" name=\"q\" value=\"\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><p class=\"bd-form__actions\"><button class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--primary\" type=\"submit\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Search</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></button></p></form></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Frequently asked\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Frequently asked</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-faq\" data-bl-b=\"\"><article id=\"when-and-where\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-when-and-where\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"When and where is the wedding?\"><h3 id=\"faq-when-and-where\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">When and where is the wedding?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027, at the Chicago Athletic Association Hotel, 12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"what-time\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-what-time\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What time does it start?\"><h3 id=\"faq-what-time\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What time does it start?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Please arrive 15–30 minutes before the ceremony. Ceremony and reception times will appear on The Wedding page once our planner confirms them.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"dress-code\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-dress-code\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What should I wear?\"><h3 id=\"faq-dress-code\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What should I wear?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We would love to see you dressed up for an evening in a historic ballroom—cocktail attire or anything more formal. Black tie is welcome.</span></p><ul><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Men: a suit with a dress shirt, preferably with a tie (a tuxedo is welcome too).</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Women: a cocktail dress, an elegant jumpsuit, dressy separates, or a formal gown.</span></li></ul><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Please skip jeans, chinos, and khakis.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"kids\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-kids\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can we bring our kids?\"><h3 id=\"faq-kids\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can we bring our kids?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Please refer to your invitation for the guests included in your party. If you have questions about your invitation, please reach out to us.</span></p></div></article><article id=\"plus-ones\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-plus-ones\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I bring a plus-one?\"><h3 id=\"faq-plus-ones\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I bring a plus-one?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Please refer to your invitation for the guests included in your party. If you have questions about your invitation, please reach out to us.</span></p></div></article><article id=\"parking\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-parking\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where do I park?\"><h3 id=\"faq-parking\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where do I park?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel’s valet entrance, parking options, and current rates are kept as dated records on Our Venue, each with the day we last checked them against the hotel’s own page.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/our-venue#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our Venue</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"weather\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-weather\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What if it rains?\"><h3 id=\"faq-weather\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What if it rains?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our ceremony and reception will take place indoors at the Chicago Athletic Association. Check the weather before traveling, especially if you’ll be exploring the city.</span></p></div></article><article id=\"photos\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-photos\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I take photos?\"><h3 id=\"faq-photos\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I take photos?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We invite you to be fully present during our unplugged ceremony by putting away your phones and cameras. Share this special moment with us while our photographer captures the memories.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/photos\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos &amp; Video</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"accessibility\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-accessibility\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Is the venue accessible?\"><h3 id=\"faq-accessibility\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Is the venue accessible?</span></h3><ul class=\"bd-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"bd-badge bd-badge--info\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel describes its accessible rooms and features on its own FAQ page; the link and the date we last checked it are on Our Venue.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">accessibility details for the ceremony and reception rooms once they are chosen.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/our-venue#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our Venue</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"rsvp\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-rsvp\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I RSVP?\"><h3 id=\"faq-rsvp\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I RSVP?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign in with a one-time code sent to the email on your invitation to see your guest details and RSVP when it opens. You can return to your guest account to review your reply and change meal selections once the menu is available and meal changes are open.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/rsvp\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">RSVP</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"travel\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-travel\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where should I stay, and how do I get there?\"><h3 id=\"faq-travel\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where should I stay, and how do I get there?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay covers getting to Chicago and getting around downtown. Sign in to see your room-block booking code, rate, and book-by date at the Chicago Athletic Association.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/travel\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"gifts\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-gifts\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Do you have a registry?\"><h3 id=\"faq-gifts\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Do you have a registry?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your presence at our wedding is the greatest gift. Sign in to see our Gifts page for the details.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/gifts\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Gifts</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"contact\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-contact\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I reach you?\"><h3 id=\"faq-contact\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I reach you?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Email us at hello@kendrick.wedding. We read every message and share questions with our wedding planner, Michelle Elaine Sunder of Bustle &amp; Lace.</span></p></div></article><article id=\"dietary-needs\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-dietary-needs\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What if I have dietary restrictions or food alle\"><h3 id=\"faq-dietary-needs\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What if I have dietary restrictions or food allergies?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign in to review your RSVP and the dietary information you can share with us. Meal choices will appear once the menu is available; we’ll share any additional catering guidance as it is confirmed.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/rsvp/attending\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the page</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"getting-to-venue\" class=\"bd-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-getting-to-venue\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I get to the wedding venue?\"><h3 id=\"faq-getting-to-venue\" class=\"bd-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I get to the wedding venue?</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose bd-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our wedding takes place at the Chicago Athletic Association Hotel, 12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603. See Travel &amp; Stay for directions, parking, and getting around downtown.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/travel\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"concierge\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"concierge-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Ask a question\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"concierge-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Ask a question</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-slot\" id=\"concierge-slot\" data-slot=\"concierge\"><div class=\"cq\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p class=\"cq__intro\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ask a question in your own words. The concierge answers only from what this site knows, shows you the page each fact came from, and says when something is not decided yet.</span></p><p class=\"cq__s